    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Stéphanie Lavoie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115527774646447626092/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWaPjO1v3wu_xk4KXVMgmXKxQP5t0i222CU4j0R0Xfg4PtOQlI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Absolutely love this yoga studio! The teachers are truly amazing — patient, knowledgeable, and so good at guiding you through each movement. The ambiance is calm, clean, and so beautifully set up that you relax the moment you walk in. Every class leaves me feeling refreshed and grounded. Highly recommend it to anyone looking for a warm, welcoming, and high-quality yoga experience! 🙏✨",
        "time": 1763596514,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Leïla Mcquillen",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100787600222825216924/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJjy28-H9aLd5SYwLekTvX6p4q1k0nq9dqylv1DYIq0kWgA-g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I have loved every single experience at this studio, so that’s about 15 relaxing, motivational, hard, focused and sweaty sessions. I prefer the classes where you work a bit harder, but they are accompanied with about 15 minutes of deep streching at the end, it’s great! The class temperature is perfect and offers a room\nwhere you can relax and feel your body detoxing. Idolem is really my studio of choice, plus their staff is amazing 🙌🏼",
        "time": 1764338764,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dasha Zoeger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115751144246575375340/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUHCE95lP-UrYVcwgiHCTz1Ecu7zG6KDUrrUUvYJ_WP_OBRrrK6=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Idolem is truly a haven of warmth and peace. Every visit has been incredibly welcoming— the staff always greets you with genuine kindness and creates an atmosphere that feels calm and uplifting from the moment you walk in. Each experience has been consistently pleasant, grounding, and overall amazing. I couldn’t recommend this hot yoga studio more!",
        "time": 1763607912,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Kelly Turpin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104794001246171109990/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUp1Fo-4j36kAZ1zPe_muqKxeUz1T1yIB6C0w6KK9PNkUldyaED=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I have been practicing at Idolem yoga Vaudreuil since they opened. It is such a safe space for me. Just the smell when you walk through the doors is comforting. So relaxing and zen. They teachers and staff are amazing. Also they have a variety of different classes.  I highly recommend it to anyone and everyone 💛 Namaste",
        "time": 1763590460,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Monika T",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116004312716840807607/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwWdJj2FvPWQ7CsYnQ3DIKwp2doYIOEgHzntvrva0hy-PY7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "A cozy/intimate spot. I was nervous to get started but the staff & the teachers made this place feel inviting no matter my level. I love the sense of community here! Looking forward to many more classes at Idoleme!",
        "time": 1763754569,
        "translated": false
